# Install backend dependencies with: pip install -r requirements.txt
# Enable the Google Cloud Text-to-Speech and Cloud Translation APIs in your
# Google Cloud project.
# For local development, authenticate with: gcloud auth application-default login
# Alternatively, keep a service-account JSON outside this repository and set
# GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS to its absolute path in the backend environment.
# Start the API from the project root with: uvicorn backend.main:app --reload --port 8000